{"header":{"status":{"name":"Success","code":0,"description":"Query success","apiHelp":"https://www.censtatd.gov.hk/sc/web_table.html?id=315-37001&api_popup=1"},"title":"国际收支平衡","tablenote":["由于数字经四舍五入，分项总和未必与总数相等。     经常账户或资本账户的差额为正数值代表盈余，而负数值则代表赤字。     自2023年6月起，金融账户的整系数列已采用新的正负号常规。自此，资产／负债增加以正数值标示。注意：资产增加表示资金净流出，而负债增加则表示资金净流入。因此，金融账户差额增加（即资产减去负债为正数值）表示资金净流出。     在国际收支平衡架构下储备及非储备资产的估计数字是指交易数字。因估值方式改变（包括价格变动及汇率变动）及重新分类所导致的影响并没计算在内。","@ 数字在日后会作出修订。"],"source":"政府统计处国际收支平衡统计科 (一)  (查询电话：3863 2329  查询电邮：bop@censtatd.gov.hk)","count":{"noOfRecords":61,"started":"2026-10-20T20:02:02+00:00","finished":"2026-10-20T20:02:02+00:00","durationSeconds":0.082587}},"dataSet":[{"BOP_COMPONENT":"BOP_C","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"整体的国际收支","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":-40165,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"CPA","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"资本账户","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":-38,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"CRA","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"经常账户","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":22226,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DI","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"直接投资","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":20806,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"FA","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"金融账户","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":11027,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"FD","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"金融衍生工具","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":-25550,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"FNRA","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"非储备金融资产","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":51192,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"G","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"货物","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":127920,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"NEO","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"净误差及遗漏","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":-11161,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"OI","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"其他投资","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":22